  "tamil": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "text": "[கருடன் பதிப்பகம்"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "text": "புண்யகோடி: எத்துக்காக இதெல்லாம் சொல்றேன்னா தொழிலாளர் கோரிக்கை கூடிய சீக்கிரம் நிறைவேறியாகணும். நம்மை நம்பிகிட்டு ஆயிரக் கணக்கான தொழிலாளிகள் இருக்காங்க!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : கவலைப்படாதீர்!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "text": "புண்யகோடி: நீங்க அதுக்குத்தான் திட்டம் தீட்றிங்கன்னு தெரியுது! இருந்தாலும் சில தொழிலாளிங்க கொஞ்சங்-"
      },
      {
        "kind": "prose",
        "text": "கொஞ்சமா அந்தப் பாண்டியன் கட்சியிலே சேர்ந்துகிட்டு, பகுத்தறிவு அது இதுன்னு பேசிகிட்டு நம்பளை கொஞ்சம் கேவலமா நினைக்கிறாங்க!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : பரவாயில்லை. அவர்களால் என்ன செய்ய முடியும்? அவனுந்தான் ஜெயில்ல கிடக்கிறான். உம். நீங்க போங்க நான் எல்லாம் உடனடியாக கவனிக்கிறேன்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "text": "புண்யகோடி : நான் வர்ரேன். நமஸ்காரம். என்ன, உங்களைத்தானே..."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன்: வாழ்க தொழிலாளி வர்க்கம் !"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : இவன் வேற தொழிலாளி தொழிலாளின்னு உயிரைவாங்குறான்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன்: அட சும்மா இருப்பா ! அந்தத் திரை மறைவிலே தானே நம்ம நினைச்சதெல்லாம் நடத்த முடியுது!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : நினைத்ததெல்லாம் வெற்றிதான்,ஆனாலும் அந்த உஷா விஷயம் Failure ஆயிட்டுதே !"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன் : அதெல்லாம் ஒண்ணும் ஆகாது ! அதுக்குத்தான் சொல்றேன், நீ உஷாவை கல்யாணம் பண்ணிட்டீன்னா, அவ்வளவு பெரிய மில்லு உனக்குச் சொந்தம்! ஆயிரக் கணக்கான தொழிலாளிகள் உனக்கு அடிமை ..."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : தொழிலாளி தலைவன் மில் முதலாளி மகளை கல்யாணம் செய்வது....."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன் : அட ''மாஸ் சைகாலஜி\" தெரியாது உனக்கு? அதுக்கும் ஒரு காரணம் சொல்லிவிடலாம்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : சொல்லலாம். ஆனால் முன்னுக்குப் பின் முரணாகப் பேசுவது"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன்: அப்படித்தான் பேசணும், அப்பறம் தலைவர்னா என்னா லக்ஷணம் நான் சொல்றபடி செய்யப்பா !"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : உஷாவைக் கல்யாணம் பண்ணவேண்டும். அவ்வளவு தானே!"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன் : ஆமாம்! அப்படிச் செஞ்சா எவ்வளவோ காரியத்துக்கு செளகரியம். முதல்ல நம்ப பதிப்பகத்தையே விருத்தி பண்ணலாம்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன்: சரி, அக்காளிடமே சொல்லி பெண் கேட்கச் சொல்வோம்."
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன் : அட, இதுக்கெல்லாம் ஏம்ப்பா அக்கா. அதுவேற எதுக்கெடுத்தாலும் தடை சொல்லும் சனியன் மாதிரி !"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "text": "பரந்தாமன் : ஏ கருடா! நிதானமா பேசு! எங்க அக்காளைப் பத்தி எதுவும் பேசாதே !"
      },
      {
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "text": "கருடன் : மன்னிச்சிக்கோ, மன்னிச்சுக்க ஒரு டெஸ்ட் பாத்தேன். அக்காகிட்ட தம்பிக்கு எவ்வளவு அன்பு இருக்குன்னு ........"
      },
      {
        "kind": "separator",
        "text": "★"
      }
    ]
  },
  "english": {
    "units": [
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u001",
        "kind": "stage-direction",
        "speakerLabel": null,
        "sourceRecordId": null,
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 79,
            "printedPage": 71
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Garudan Publishing House.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 79,
            "printedPage": 71
          }
        ],
        "text": "The reason I'm saying all this is that the workers' demands must be fulfilled very soon. Thousands of workers are depending on us!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 79,
            "printedPage": 71
          }
        ],
        "text": "Don't worry!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 79,
            "printedPage": 71
          },
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "I know you're making plans for that! Even so, little by little some workers are joining that Pandiyan's party, talking about rationalism and all that, and looking down on us somewhat!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "Never mind. What can they do? He's lying in jail himself. Hmm. You go; I'll attend to everything immediately.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "புண்யகோடி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'll be going. Namaskaram. What, you...",
        "notes": [
          "The printed utterance ends unfinished at `என்ன, உங்களைத்தானே...`; no completion is supplied."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "Long live the working class!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "This fellow too keeps tormenting me with 'workers, workers.'",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u009",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d008",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh, keep quiet! Isn't it only behind that curtain that we can carry out everything we want!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u010",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d009",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "Everything we planned has succeeded, but that Usha matter was a failure!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u011",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d010",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "That won't matter at all! That's why I'm telling you: if you marry Usha, that enormous mill becomes yours! Thousands of workers become your slaves...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u012",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d011",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "A workers' leader marrying a mill owner's daughter....",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u013",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d012",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "Don't you know 'mass psychology'? We can give a reason for that too.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u014",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d013",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "We can. But speaking inconsistently from one time to the next...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u015",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d014",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "That's exactly how you must speak; otherwise what is the mark of a leader? Do as I say, man!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u016",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d015",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 80,
            "printedPage": 72
          }
        ],
        "text": "I must marry Usha. That's all, isn't it!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u017",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d016",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Yes! If you do that, it'll make many things convenient. First of all, we can expand our publishing house itself.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u018",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d017",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "All right, we'll tell akka and have her ask for the bride.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u019",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d018",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oh, why bring akka into all this? She's like a Saturn that objects to everything!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u020",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d019",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hey, Garuda! Watch your words! Don't say anything about my akka!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u021",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d020",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "Forgive me, forgive me!",
        "notes": [
          "The corrected dialogue corpus deliberately preserves the historical d020/d021 split for one printed Garudan utterance so stable source IDs are not renumbered."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s063-u022",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s063-d021",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 81,
            "printedPage": 73
          }
        ],
        "text": "I was just testing how much love the younger brother has for his akka........",
        "notes": [
          "Continuation of the same printed Garudan utterance represented by stable source record d021."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
